%% Author: GoodReason cycle (Architect design, verified against implementation)
%% Created: 2026-05-21
%% Topic: run-issues clarification answer-and-continue loop (α2)
%% Task: NEEDS_CLARIFICATION → maintainer replies on the issue → Studio continues from S6
%%
%% Companion to run-issues-state-machine.mmd. This sequence view shows the
%% cross-machine flow: the run + worktree + lock live on Studio (host gate),
%% but maintainer can reply from anywhere; the Studio poller is the only trigger.
%% Bot and human share the same GitHub account (maintainer), so the reply is
%% detected by timestamp vs. an embedded marker, not by comment author.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Orch as orchestrate.sh (Studio)
    participant GH as GitHub Issue
    participant maintainer
    participant Poller as poller.sh (Studio)

    Note over Orch: S6 run_cycle_review → NEEDS_CLARIFICATION
    Orch->>Orch: state_finalize awaiting_clarification<br/>(clarification_round, awaiting_answer_since)
    Orch->>GH: _post_situation_to_issue (awaitable=1)<br/>full analysis + marker ts=T round=n
    Orch->>GH: add label "waiting"
    Orch--xOrch: release lock + exit 11<br/>(GitHub assignee + waiting label kept)

    maintainer->>GH: reply comment<br/>(createdAt > T, no run-issues: token)

    loop every 5 min (host gate: only this machine's runs)
        Poller->>Poller: scan_answered: local awaiting_clarification run?<br/>(host == hostname -s, round < MAX)
        Poller->>GH: fetch_issue_json + parse_marker + detect_answer(T)
        alt reply found & round < MAX_CLARIFICATIONS
            Poller->>Orch: tmux run-issues-continue-<issue>:<br/>orchestrate.sh --continue <run-dir>
            Orch->>Orch: lock + validate worktree<br/>clarification_round++ (before claude)
            Orch->>GH: read reply → CLARIFICATION_CONTEXT
            Orch->>Orch: S6 run_cycle_review (enriched context)
            alt PROCEED
                Orch->>GH: remove label "waiting"
                Orch->>Orch: Phase B → implementer → PR
            else still NEEDS_CLARIFICATION & round < MAX
                Orch->>GH: new marker round=n+1 + sharper question
                Orch--xOrch: re-park, exit 11 (loop continues)
            else BLOCKER (environment fix)
                Orch->>GH: _hand_to_human + needs-human, remove waiting
                Orch--xOrch: exit 4 (no loop)
            end
        else round >= MAX_CLARIFICATIONS
            Orch->>GH: _hand_to_human + needs-human, remove waiting
            Orch--xOrch: exit 0 (human takes over)
        end
    end
